{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：国巨业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">国巨（2327.TW）2Q26财报交出了一份超出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>与市场预期的成绩单。单季净利润新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">94.18亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">88%</span>，分别高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测和市场共识<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。这份报告最值得关注的判断并非单季数字本身，而是公司AI收入占比升至16%、订单出货比（BB ratio）攀升至2.2，以及管理层对3Q26产能利用率将突破九成的指引——三者叠加，指向被动元件供需正在收紧。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在报告中上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>每股盈余预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>，估值倍数从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40倍</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35倍</span>。，而是反映行业整体估值倍数压缩。报告更新公司观点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXhp7iczfKUUuWkRw09vDJBUyaOicOMW0d1FnJMLibBfDrCMkFLA48XDmUY6bzHsGH2ZhM9S73hmic3ibYxceZibhOrr8U5CrXmXXTuE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">价格数据与市场变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">国巨2Q26毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.5%</span>，环比提升0.4个百分点，同比提升2.9个百分点，但略低于市场共识的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.9%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>指出，毛利率低于共识的原因是大宗品出货占比提升稀释了产品组合。不过，报告同时观察到早期价格传导已经开始流入利润率——<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>涨价效应尚未完全反映在当季数字中。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">营业利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.4%</span>，环比提升1.2个百分点，同比提升4.9个百分点，超出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测0.9个百分点。规模效应与费用控制是主要驱动。营收新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">444.56亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">36%</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 毛利率低于共识但营业利润率高于共识，这个组合值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>。大宗品占比上升压低了毛利率，但费用率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>和规模效应弥补了这部分缺口。读这张表时，别只看毛利率一个数，营业利润率的走势更能说明经营杠杆的实际释放。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWEBHg41ArxkpTKUZxjsicR2m8bJo5iamaKicFD3cr5UdpkU8lyhpseJhmdZv34Ser91Smw8RZps8QOpVXWFavDTjFZVtXRY2a5dQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层指引3Q26营收温和增长，毛利率与营业利润率小幅<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。更关键的信号是产能利用率：大宗品从2Q26的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">90%</span>，特殊品从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">85%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">90%</span>以上。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>认为，这指向供给端正在收紧。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">BB ratio从股东会时的1.3升至6月底的2.2，环比持续攀升。这一指标反映订单流入速度显著快于出货速度，是前瞻需求可见度的直接证据。管理层同时提到，AI、计算和存储终端市场的客户对签署多年期长约（LTA）的兴趣正在上升，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>认为<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>潜在需求跑赢此前预期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXTNBVgQBJjcOFiawA2Y5icNgqicaRNCqE4sKaQqnEDnibsWeOzyxhmxhoFCxAO3L0VDuCSYUQNhaMaEZIZCoO9rvxBwq3BpcoJETA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>将国巨MLCC、电阻、钽电容三条产品线的ASP增长CAGR假设分别从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">27%</span>。这是本次盈利预测上调的核心驱动。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">从修正幅度看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>营收预测上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，营业利润上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，净利润上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>-13%。毛利率预测基本持平，费用率预测下调0.8-0.9个百分点——盈利上调主要来自收入规模扩Daiwa经营杠杆，而非利润率假设的放松。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4. 一个可复用的观察框架：区分业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告提供了一个值得保留的分析框架：将公司层面的盈利变化与行业层面的估值变化分开处理。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXVM6o8I14kOhMj1ywwUPESaAnkCfZxIJwicDsMYqCw5D4xBicSeOSKATmITJ7wDy0SU4hXRFC67pG3ANb2DgRFSCpvSHtUdoCEc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 21-CITI-Yageo -2327.TW- 2Q26 Beat on Broad-Based Strength- Recalibrating Intact-260729</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
